Backport of FFmpeg master commits:
  2501954d49 avformat/rtpdec: fix RTCP RR cumulative packet loss clamping
  b4d11dffbf avformat/rtpdec_av1: fix operator precedence in packet allocation
  9cf34b031f avformat/rtpdec: propagate SRTP setup errors to the caller
  f5d4fd186c avformat/rtsp: limit the number of redirects
  e5fe2cbebc avformat/rtpdec_h264: Ignore framesize attributes without a height
  8d8616a510 avformat/rtpdec_opus: Reject empty payloads
  a7b20ee103 avformat/rtsp: Validate the SampleRate SDP attribute
  97801e53f0 avformat/rtpdec: fix dropped payload after reordering-queue delivery
  5af7de7e3d avformat/rtpdec_av1: Read the OBU header byte after the size checks

